Map:map_pk_mountains_of_tyranny/Desc
"Under ice and snow lies the final stand of the Free Peoples.\nThangorodrim has awakened, and its fire now shapes the frozen north.\nDarkness spreads unchecked, and the world remembers only silence.\n In honor of Casper, FFA Tourney Winner \n Map by Powerkartoffel"
END